      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "S-2 scooter batteries purchased on or after 1 January 2025 carry a warranty of 18 months from the purchase date."
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The warranty covers the scooter's removable 36 V battery pack, part BP36-2."
    }
